Object.assign(UI.en,{
  help:'How to use Stiko and safety',
  aboutTitle:'Welcome to Stiko',
  aboutIntro:'Stiko is a stick figure who shows you each exercise, counts your reps and times your rests. Everything stays on your phone and works offline.',
  howTitle:'How to use it',
  how:['**Sessions**: pick a ready-made session and tap **Start**. Stiko leads you through the warm-up, the main block and the cool-down.',
    'Tap **Edit** to change sets, reps, holds and rests, remove exercises or add new ones. You can also make your own session with **New session**.',
    '**Exercises**: browse and filter the whole library. Tap an exercise to watch it, with step-by-step instructions and easier or harder options.',
    'While Stiko plays, tap the figure to pause and drag sideways to go through a movement slowly. **Sound** and **Voice** turn the cues on and off.',
    'Add Stiko to your home screen (browser menu → Add to Home screen) to open it like an app.',
    'Sessions are saved on this phone only. Use **Export backup** on the Sessions screen to keep a copy.'],
  safetyTitle:'Your health comes first',
  safety:['Stiko gives general fitness guidance. It is not medical advice and does not replace a doctor or physiotherapist.',
    'Talk to your doctor before you start, especially if you are new to exercise or older, are pregnant, or have a heart condition, high blood pressure, diabetes, joint or back problems, or a recent injury or operation.',
    'Start easy, with fewer sets and reps than suggested, and build up over weeks. Effort is fine; pain is not.',
    'Stop at once if you feel chest pain or pressure, dizziness, unusual shortness of breath or sharp pain. Get medical help if it doesn’t pass.',
    'For balance exercises, keep a sturdy chair, counter or wall within reach.',
    'You exercise at your own risk and are responsible for staying within your limits.'],
  getStarted:'Got it, let’s start', aboutBack:'Back to sessions',
});
